/meaning/category/sea-life/*     /tattoo-meaning/ocean/:splat 301
/tattoo-meaning/sea-life         /tattoo-meaning/ocean       301
/tattoo-meaning/sea-life/*       /tattoo-meaning/ocean/:splat 301
# generic: old /meaning/category/:category drops the /category/ segment
/meaning/category/:category    /tattoo-meaning/:category    301
/meaning/*                     /tattoo-meaning/:splat       301
